  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let the A. P. be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></math><br />The sum of the terms <math><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math><br />Given,&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>27</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>35</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>27</mn><mn>35</mn></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>35</mn><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>144</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>35</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>144</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>32</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>35</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>27</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />So the numbers are: <math><mn>6,10,14,18</mn></math>",
